    "show_share": true,
    "description": "During the 4-day research retreat, the School took the opportunity to hold a celebration dinner to acknowledge faculty for their hard work and dedication. Notably, acknowledgements included: Joseph Mwizerwa (Academic Head, SONAM-Kampala), Abubaker Mohammed, Moses Wankiiri and Carolyne Namukwaya, all of whom recently completed their Post Graduate Diploma in Medical Education at Makerere University, Uganda; Gladys Mbuthia, Sindhu Ramalingam, Grace Nakate, Cliff Aliga, Jane Kabo and Joan Musau who successfully completed the first year of their PhD at UNiSA and secured ethics approval; and Edna Tallam (CEO/Registrar, Nursing Council of Kenya), Isabel Kambo, Diana Kassaman, Judith Mutyabule, Joseph Mwizerwa, Samuel Mulongo and Victor Mathias for successful completion of the Stellenbosch University pre-doctorate programme.",
